# Check of the new v2 questions with a different LLM family

**Author:** Yaren Gürsoy · [KAN-227](https://yarengursoy.atlassian.net/browse/KAN-227) (task [KAN-170](https://yarengursoy.atlassian.net/browse/KAN-170))

The new questions of Q&A dataset v2 (D8) were drafted with Claude Opus 5.5 by the use case authors. Before the new `test` questions are fixed on 05/12/2026, they are checked with an LLM from a different family, which reads only the gold provisions of each question. Every finding is checked by hand against the consolidated text of 27/07/2026 and resolved. The questions are not used for tuning prompts, retrieval or rules.

KAN-227 asks for the new `test` questions. The second round also covers the new `val` questions, because the check costs nothing extra and the `val` split is frozen on 01/12/2026.

