### Prompt

Round 2 had two steps in the same chat. First, the check (the 24 question blocks followed it):

~~~text
Quick independent check of 24 evaluation questions for a RAG assistant on the EU AI Act (consolidated text of 27/07/2026, education use cases in Annex III, point 3). The questions and gold answers were drafted with Claude; you are a second checker from another model family.

Use ONLY the provision texts given under each question, not your own knowledge. Keep it short.

Check each question for:
